        "Give the common antihypertensives, diuretics, nitrates, statins and antiplatelets with the observation each requires — the pulse before a beta-blocker, the potassium with diuretics, the cough and the pregnancy test with ACE inhibitors, the ankle swelling of calcium-channel blockers, first-dose hypotension — and counsel for adherence.",
