          caption: "Tremor, vomiting and slurred speech in the lithium patient who has been vomiting or sweating; fever plus rigidity days into an antipsychotic; a twisted neck and rolled eyes hours after haloperidol; lip-smacking after years. Four different combinations, four different responses.",
