          alt: "Getting an honest answer about herbal use — questions that close the conversation ('you are not taking any of that herbal thing are you', 'why would you take that instead of your tablets', 'you must stop all of it immediately') each teach the patient to stop telling you; questions that open it ('many people use something from home as well — what have you been taking', 'anything you drink, chew, rub on or take as an enema') get the truth.",
